    {
      "source_id": 5329,
      "position": 0,
      "japanese": "あなたの助けがなかったら、我々は仕事を間に合わせられなかったであろう。",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%82%e3%81%aa%e3%81%9f%e3%81%ae%e5%8a%a9%e3%81%91%e3%81%8c%e3%81%aa%e3%81%8b%e3%81%a3%e3%81%9f%e3%82%89%e3%80%81%e6%88%91%e3%80%85%e3%81%af%e4%bb%95%e4%ba%8b%e3%82%92%e9%96%93%e3%81%ab%e5%90%88%e3%82%8f%e3%81%9b%e3%82%89%e3%82%8c%e3%81%aa%e3%81%8b%e3%81%a3%e3%81%9f\"><span>あなたの助けがなかったら、我々は仕事を間に合わせられなかった</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%a7%e3%81%82%e3%82%8d%e3%81%86%e3%80%82\"><strong>であろう。</strong></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "あなたの助けがなかったら、我々は仕事を間に合わせられなかった",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "であろう。",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        }
      ],
      "reading": "あなたのたすけがなかったら、われわれはしごとをまにあわせられなかったであろう。",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "If it weren't for your help, we probably  wouldn't have finished this job in time.",
          "html": "<span>If it weren't for your help, we </span><strong>probably </strong><span> wouldn't have finished this job in time. </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "If it weren't for your help, we ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            },
            {
              "text": "probably ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": " wouldn't have finished this job in time. ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
